Do not require real names or public personal details.

Do not expose authentication identifiers.

Enable the appropriate Supabase anonymous sign-in settings and configure CAPTCHA protection before public launch.

Use secure session handling.

Use authorization checks on the server and Row Level Security in PostgreSQL.

